        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[War in Iran Has Cost US $38 Billion Over Five Months, CBO Says]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[President Donald Trump’s decision to go to war against Iran has cost US taxpayers about $38 billion in direct costs during the first five months of fighting and will push inflation up about 0.5 percentage points by early next year, a new congressional study finds.]]></description>
            <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-15/war-in-iran-has-cost-us-38-billion-over-five-months-cbo-says</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">TLDRGYT96OSI00</guid>
            <dc:creator><![CDATA[Gregory Korte and Erik Wasson]]></dc:creator>
            <pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 18:00:29 GMT</pubDate>
        </item>
