            <title><![CDATA[Merz Cancels UN Trip to Address CDU Party Rebellion in Berlin  ]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[German Chancellor Friedrich Merz cancelled his trip to the United Nations General Assembly in New York next week, changing course as he works to contain an open rebellion of his own party in Berlin.]]></description>
            <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-15/merz-cancels-trip-to-un-in-new-york-amidst-party-rebellion</link>
