            <title><![CDATA[NYC Postpones Vote on Property-Tax Break for Hudson Yards Tower]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[New York City put off voting on a $100 million property tax break for a new Hudson Yards skyscraper proposed by developer Tishman Speyer, in what would be the largest economic subsidy since Mayor Zohran Mamdani took office.]]></description>
