            <title><![CDATA[Trump's Intent on $5,000 Checks Is Very Real, Bessent Says ]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent says the Treasury is looking at President Donald Trump's proposal to give each American adult $5,000 if Republicans keep control of Congress after the November elections. He says President Trump's intent is very real. Bessent testifies before the House Financial Services Committee. (Source: Bloomberg)]]></description>
            <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-09-15/trump-s-intent-on-5-000-checks-is-very-real-bessent-video</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">TLEZEHKGZAJ200</guid>
