        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Bessent Says He’s Supportive of $5,000 Checks for Americans]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent said he’s supportive of a plan floated by President Donald Trump to send $5,000 checks to American adults if Republicans retain their majorities in Congress, downplaying concerns about the potential cost.]]></description>
            <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-15/bessent-says-he-s-supportive-of-5-000-checks-for-americans</link>
